      "text": [
        "1700 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «قَرْضُ اَلْمُؤْمِنِ غَنِيمَةٌ وَ تَعْجِيلُ خَيْرٍ إِنْ أَيْسَرَ أَدَّاهُ وَ إِنْ مَاتَ اُحْتُسِبَ مِنْ زَكَاتِهِ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1700 - Imam (as) said: \"Lending to a believer is a gain and a hastening of goodness; if he becomes able to repay, he does so, and if he dies, it is counted as part of his zakat.\""
        ]
      }
